WEBVTT

00:10:31.875 --> 00:10:36.305
If Chibok were more
connected through trade,

00:10:37.344 --> 00:10:41.141
and those young men
who joined Boko Haram had an option

00:10:41.165 --> 00:10:43.530
to get a job in the formal economy,

00:10:44.784 --> 00:10:46.808
would those girls still be in school?

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.825
I think so.

00:10:50.288 --> 00:10:53.557
Trade would have given them
a weapon to fight terrorism.

00:10:54.009 --> 00:10:56.059
Trade would have given them hope.

00:10:56.551 --> 00:10:57.758
Thank you.

00:10:57.782 --> 00:11:02.515
(Applause)